      <data key="d1">"The UNB is a public university in Brazil that offers various undergraduate, graduate programs"&lt;SEP&gt;"The UNB is a public university in Brazil"&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasília is a Brazilian public university"&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasília"&lt;SEP&gt;"Universidade Federal de Brasília (UNB) is a public university in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universidade de Brasília is the organization mentioned throughout the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universities of Brazil"</data>
